#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/content-change-review-committee.bpmn:166
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "`uses[]` is what a READER must have read to follow the block — never populated from the formal dependency graph. Once every changed block is covered, the committee checks the editorial dependencies of the change as a whole before judging its impact. Reading order is a property of folio content, so the step belongs to the content process, which reaches the harness's review by calling DOWN into `review-task`."
msgstr ""

