#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/content-change-review-committee.bpmn:138
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "adjudication.bpmn. When the editor and a reviewer, or two reviewers, disagree about a finding, an adjudicator settles it and records why; the review comment moves to `adjudicated` with the Decision that closed it. Permitted answers: `stands` — the finding is right and the author addresses it; `withdrawn` — the finding is wrong and the comment closes. Recorded on the comment, not branched: either way the flow goes on to the coverage check."
msgstr ""

